   <title><![CDATA[180. Kuyperian Politics pt.4: Justice [Leadership Now Podcast]]]></title>
   <link/>
   <description><![CDATA[<p>Tune into this week's episode as Dr. Aaron Rock covers the topic of 'justice' from a Kuyperian perspective. What leads to the downfall of a nation's justice system, what can we learn from God about justice, and what even is justice in the first place? All of that and more on this episode of Leadership Now with Dr. Aaron Rock.</p>
